      "description": "Watch Cambuur vs Twente highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 31, 2026. The stadium was buzzing with anticipation for this Eredivisie encounter, as both sides looked to make their mark on the season with a decisive performance. Twente establish early dominance On August 31, 2026 , Twente seized the initiative early, controlling the tempo and forcing Cambuur onto the back foot. The breakthrough arrived in the 22nd minute when Ruud Nijstad fired home a strike from outside the box following a clever assist from Bart van Rooij . The momentum stayed firmly with the visitors, and just four minutes later, Wout Weghorst doubled the lead after connecting with a ball from Joel Drommel . By the time the half-time whistle blew, Twente had established a commanding foothold in the match. Clinical execution and late drama Any hopes of a Cambuur resurgence were dampened immediately after the interval when Marko Pjaca scored with a left-footed effort, set up by Sondre Oerjasaeter . As the game approached its conclusion, Cambuur introduced fresh legs in a bid to change their fortunes. Ilyes Hamache provided a spark for the hosts in the 88th minute with a long-range goal, but it proved to be a consolation. Despite a late flurry from the home side, Twente held firm to secure a well-deserved victory in front of an attendance of 13,105, showcasing their class with 64% ball possession."
